    "text": "emporianews.com\nwebsite\nEmporia\nEmporia Healthcare Center Receives $485,000 Grant\nBy Marina,\n1 days agoEMPORIA (KSNT) – In a significant step toward improving healthcare access in rural Kansas, Newman Regional Health announced it has received a $485,000 grant from The Patterson Family Foundation. This funding aims to expand and modernize the hospital’s telehealth infrastructure, enabling better healthcare delivery to underserved communities. About...\n1\nComments\nYOU MAY ALSO LIKE\nGreg Wilson, CFA\n·\nuser · 19.6K followers\n8 Foods You Can Eat A Lot Of Without Gaining Weight, According to a Dietitian\nKim Yawitz, RD, is a registered dietitian and gym owner in St. Louis, Mo. In addition to coaching fitness and nutrition clients one-on-one and in small groups, Kim also shares her expertise with national media outlets. She enjoys cooking, reading, and spending time with her family.\nSt. Louis, MO ·21d\nThe KLC Journal\n·\nuser · 687 followers",
